msgid "UB Overflow 问题排查指南"
msgstr "UB Overflow Troubleshooting Guide"

msgid "概述"
msgstr "Overview"

msgid "UB Overflow 是 Triton-Ascend 开发中常见的问题。本文档详细介绍 UB Overflow 的常见原因、解决方案和调试方法。"
msgstr "UB Overflow is a common issue in Triton-Ascend development. This document describes the common causes, solutions, and debugging methods for UB Overflow."

msgid "常见原因及解决方案"
msgstr "Common causes and solutions"

msgid "1. 使用了会增加 UB 开销的接口参数"
msgstr "1\\. You used API parameters that increase UB overhead."

msgid "某些接口在特定参数配置下会自动添加额外的处理逻辑，导致 UB 空间使用增加："
msgstr "Certain interfaces automatically add extra processing logic under specific parameter configurations, increasing UB space usage:"

msgid "`tl.maximum`、`tl.minimum`、`tl.clamp` 接口的 `propagate_nan` 参数"
msgstr "The `propagate_nan` parameter of the `tl.maximum`, `tl.minimum`, and `tl.clamp` APIs"

msgid "**问题描述：** 当设置 `propagate_nan=tl.PropagateNan.NONE` 时，系统会自动添加 NaN 值检测和处理逻辑。"
msgstr "**Problem description:** When you set `propagate_nan=tl.PropagateNan.NONE`, the system automatically adds NaN value detection and handling logic."

msgid "**影响：**"
msgstr "**Impact:**"

msgid "显著增加 UB 空间使用"
msgstr "Significantly increases UB space usage"

msgid "可能导致性能下降"
msgstr "This may cause performance degradation."

msgid "**解决方案：**"
msgstr "**Solution:**"

msgid "如果输入数据不包含 NaN 值或不需要严格的 NaN 处理语义，考虑调整 `propagate_nan` 参数值"
msgstr "If the input data does not contain NaN values or does not require strict NaN handling semantics, consider adjusting the `propagate_nan` parameter value."

msgid "在 UB 空间紧张的场景下，优先选择不会触发额外 NaN 处理的参数配置"
msgstr "In scenarios where UB space is limited, prioritize parameter configurations that do not trigger additional NaN processing."

msgid "2. 中间变量过多"
msgstr "2\\. Too many intermediate variables"

msgid "**问题：** kernel 中定义了大量临时张量或中间计算结果"
msgstr "**Problem:** The kernel defines a large number of temporary tensors or intermediate computation results."

msgid "减少不必要的中间变量"
msgstr "Reduce unnecessary intermediate variables"

msgid "复用已分配的缓冲区"
msgstr "Reuse the allocated buffer"

msgid "将大计算拆分为多个小 kernel"
msgstr "Split large computations into multiple small kernels."

msgid "3. shape 过大"
msgstr "3\\. The shape is too large"

msgid "**问题：** 处理高维/大 shape 张量"
msgstr "**Problem:** Handling high-dimensional/large shape tensors"

msgid "考虑将大 tensor 分块处理"
msgstr "Consider tiling large tensors"

msgid "修改分块策略，减小每块的大小"
msgstr "Modify the tiling strategy to reduce the size of each block."

msgid "调试建议"
msgstr "Debugging Recommendations"

msgid "**开启详细日志**"
msgstr "**Enable detailed logs**"

msgid "使用 `TRITON_DEBUG=1` 查看详细的编译信息"
msgstr "Use `TRITON_DEBUG=1` to view detailed compilation information."

msgid "定位具体哪个算子导致 UB 溢出"
msgstr "Identify the specific operator that causes a UB overflow"

msgid "**逐步排查**"
msgstr "**Step-by-step troubleshooting**"

msgid "通过注释掉部分代码，定位导致问题的具体操作"
msgstr "Locate the specific operation that causes the problem by commenting out part of the code."

msgid "**参考文档**"
msgstr "**Reference documents**"

msgid "查看各接口文档中的\"特殊限制说明\"部分"
msgstr "View the \"Special Limitations\" section in each API document."

msgid "了解可能增加 UB 开销的参数配置"
msgstr "Understand parameter configurations that may increase UB overhead"

msgid "**优化策略**"
msgstr "**Optimization Strategy**"

msgid "优先处理占用 UB 空间较大的算子"
msgstr "Prioritize operators that occupy a large amount of UB space."

msgid "考虑重新设计算法以减少中间变量"
msgstr "Consider redesigning the algorithm to reduce intermediate variables."

msgid "考虑修改分块策略"
msgstr "Consider modifying the tiling strategy."
